// Master bundle manifest for the Knockdown revive HUD.
// Place at the ROOT of the mod content folder, next to the built knockdownui.masterbundle
// (+ _linux / _mac variants) and the ReviveUI/ subfolder.
//
//   Asset_Bundle_Name  -> the built bundle filename (matches the Unity AssetBundle tag)
//   Asset_Prefix       -> Unity assets root; .dat subfolders mirror Unity subfolders 1:1
//   Asset_Bundle_Version 5 = Unity 2021 LTS (use the version Unturned ships with)

Asset_Bundle_Name knockdownui.masterbundle
Asset_Prefix Assets/KnockdownUI
Asset_Bundle_Version 5
